contentText:
Bino Rideaux and Blacc Sam, Nipsey Hussle&#8217;s brother, have been all gas, no brakes with their press run in promotion of Hussle and Bino&#8217;s collab album PROLIFIC , which arrived Aug. 14.

Their latest stop came at Billboard House on Wednesday (Sept. 9) during Billboard &#8216;s R&B/Hip-Hop Week, where Bino and Sam sat down with staff writer Michael Saponara for the Preserving the Hussle panel to talk all things PROLIFIC and how they&#8217;ve continued Nipsey Hussle&#8217;s Marathon seven years after his passing in March 2019.

